Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:05.10,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Actually... We're vampires!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:06.28,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:08.43,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell are you {\i1}doing?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.75,0:00:11.86,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,MayoPan was a way for us \Nto interact with all of you humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs16\pos(522,274.5)\3c&HA252EA&}Make sure you subscribe!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:11.86,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fs12\bord1\move(385,342.5,255,342.5)}Good morning from the dead of night~   Streaming live from an abandoned hospital at night   Please subscribe, leave comments, and hit the like button!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:17.28,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,But unless we hit a million subs tonight, \Nour channel is going to be erased!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.99,DefaultItalicsTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama, you're watching, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:20.49,DefaultItalicsTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:23.05,DefaultItalicsTop,Ichiko,0,0,0,,So please, come back right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:22.50,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:24.96,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Where are you, and what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:25.66,DefaultItalicsTop,Fu,0,0,0,,And so, today's stream is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:26.96,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:39.10,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh! Now we have vampires \Nwho are going to be "it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.35,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Vampires playing tag in an abandoned hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord3\fs16\pos(522,274.5)\3c&HA252EA&}Make sure you subscribe!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:41.35,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fs12\bord1\move(385,342.5,255,342.5)}Good morning from the dead of night~   Streaming live from an abandoned hospital at night   Please subscribe, leave comments, and hit the like button!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:44.28,DefaultItalics,Ichiko,0,0,0,,No stopping until we hit a million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:44.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\fs30\fnArial Black\3c&HFCF9F9&}Vampire Tag in an Abandoned Hospital!!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.35,0:00:44.85,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs30\fnArial Black\c&H4F06C5&\3c&H7B285F&}Vampire {\c&H8503E3&}Tag {\c&HFBF9F9&}in an {\c&H470AE1&}Abandoned {\c&HF8F9F9&}Hospital!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:45.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No stopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If they catch you, then it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:52.22,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Hey, now, we didn't start yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.51,0:00:55.49,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Looks like they're serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:57.23,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Okay, then, to kick this off...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:58.95,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let's begin this game of tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:00.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Man, this has gotten out of hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.76,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,This way, morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.41,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord4\shad2\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&}The Game of Tag Begins!!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.41,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs30\fnTimes New Roman\c&H3F09BA&\3c&HF7F7F5&}The Game of Tag Begins!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:08.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,How do I put this all together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:09.62,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.53,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Think the stream will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.53,0:01:13.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.04,0:01:14.58,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:15.98,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Also, Masaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:16.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.34,0:01:19.58,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This stream is way too reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:21.87,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Why did you reveal yourselves \Nin the first place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:23.10,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Now Mother will be on your—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.21,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Nobody watching believes any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:25.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:30.36,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HF2CCA7&\3c&HB24A32&\pos(346.5,15)}stones: damn loud explosion\Neelchair: What was that?!\Nwawawa: ?!?!\NExtra Serving of Abura Soba: Which side\Nis it in vampire tag?\NPlease Listen to Me: Did something explode?\NSuch elaborate effects~\NObemura: Really funny joke there lolol\Nribon: Where's Live-sama...?\N17765: Wait... There's way too much\Ngoing on here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:30.36,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,But we managed to lure out our hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:34.58,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Now we can shoot a game of tag \Nlike no one's seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:35.86,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What if they catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.66,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,We won't let them get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.83,0:01:44.54,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,603)\c&HF9F9CA&}2,581 watching now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:47.58,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,It's true that the audience \Nis eating this up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.91,0:01:47.58,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\fs14\c&HF2CCA7&\3c&HB24A32&\pos(303.5,46)}Obemura: Oh, look at them all run\Nponsuke: this camera switching is really...\NChocolate Chip: What a serious game of tag\NG7I5N: Are the staff amateurs?\NShould have gotten pros...\NDim-Witted Kana: It just started and it's already\Nhard to see~ I don't know if I can watch this to the end\NSayacha: No way they'll hit a million subs\NFlying Chicken: Please set up the cameras\Nso we can see everyone~~~\NRunning & Sneaker: We want to see more Fu\Nokapon: this camera work...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.57,0:01:54.31,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,She really is such a pain in the butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.55,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:01:59.03,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.64,0:02:00.60,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Cling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:06.35,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,A wild gamble ain't so bad sometimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:10.06,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I'll make sure MayoPan lives on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:14.78,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,You won't get your hands on—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:25.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.12,0:02:25.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord3\fnGeorgia\fs40\c&H3F0BB9&\3c&HF6F7FA&\pos(568.5,225.5)}Tokage's Out!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Tokage!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:32.00,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HC9B5AC&\3c&H5C3E31&\pos(325,17.5)}Green Turtle: What's going on\NKe-boy: Her fault for smoking in a hospital\NgomadanGO: No idea what's happening\Nsince the camera work sucks so much.\Nribon: Where's Live-sama...?\NWasshoi: These cameras kys kys kys\NGen: So hard to see ;w;\Npaka: How dare they do this to my Tokage-sama...!\NJshi66: they suck\NFried Mackerel Meal: Wait, isn't Fu in danger, too??\NFork Devil: Fu...\NEngawa: Ah, not good\Nwawawa: Show us how the others are doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:30.92,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.00,0:02:34.30,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.00,0:02:34.30,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.34,0:02:41.30,DefaultItalics,Fu,0,0,0,,Masaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:42.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:45.88,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Keep the stream going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:48.82,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Don't let this be the end for MayoPan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:52.87,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Everyone watching, thanks for tuning in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:56.65,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Please! Keep spreading the word \Nabout this stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:00.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Fu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.95,0:03:10.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:10.62,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord3\fnGeorgia\fs40\c&H3F0BB9&\3c&HF6F7FA&\pos(570,227)}Fu's Out!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.27,0:03:10.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You said they wouldn't get you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Who cares about {\i1}that{\i0} now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:16.50,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HF2CCA7&\3c&HB24A32&\pos(354,16.5)}flapjack octopus: oh no\N1000 km/h: They got Fu-chan too\NFork Devil: Fuuuuuuuuuuuu ;w;\Nwww.jp: wait, did she just say masaki???\Nwho-love-love: Don't you go scaring Fu\Nvckx: By Masaki, does she mean Masakichi?!\NJshi66: Masakichi?!\Nribon: Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\NMii: Is Fu okay? I'm so worried\NGoemon: So Masakichi came up with this??\NYukko: Did you get proper permission\Nto film here?\NLevel-1200: Is Masakichi there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:22.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, Ichiko! In front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:38.19,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hold this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This game of tag isn't over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:43.16,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.06,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:46.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Use the laptop to see where they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.17,0:03:47.55,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:48.79,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,1)\an8\fs22\c&HFDF6E0&\3c&H4F3623&\pos(311.5,27)}Goemon: Did I just hear Masakichi??
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:50.40,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.00,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Here with me is Masakichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:52.87,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Don't show my face! Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:54.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Um, they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:02.46,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Th-The jigsaw is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:04.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:15.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.65,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Leave them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.65,0:04:17.77,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hurry up and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:18.77,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:19.78,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Yuki-sama, there's no way—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.73,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Just go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.17,0:04:22.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Or we'll all end up out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.93,0:04:24.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Shigeyuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:25.26,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,And don't call me Shigeyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.61,0:04:36.25,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll take care of all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:38.09,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.29,0:04:44.09,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:46.82,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,M-Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:48.68,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I'm bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:49.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.83,0:04:52.35,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,First aid... We need first aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:55.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:58.11,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord4\shad1\c&HFBFEFE&\3c&HFBFEFE&\fax0.03\4c&HDAC3F4&\pos(289.5,226)\frz3.072}Please Stand By
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\bord2\c&HFBFEFE&\3c&HDAC3F4&\fax0.03\pos(289.5,226)\frz3.072}Please Stand By
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:14.94,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,They got Yuki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:15.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:19.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:22.74,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.45,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,A quick nap'll heal me right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:27.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:28.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:31.60,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,The stream is going to end...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:35.38,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,MayoPan is going to end!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:37.73,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I don't want that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:41.48,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HF7EACC&\3c&H764B35&\pos(345.5,15.5)}ribon: Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\Ntaiyaki: still not back?\NLevel-1200: Stop slacking\Nmumu: if only live was here...\NG7I5N: Taking so long, I can't watch this\NTakowasa: Stop trying to buy time for views\NFlying Chicken: What's taking so long?\NVending Machine: Did they get permission\Nfrom the owner of this abandoned hospital?\NIf they didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:41.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,After we all tried so hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.33,0:05:45.20,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,After you came to Banpai Manor...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:47.71,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Everything's been so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.27,0:05:51.51,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,That's... That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:56.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,All I wanted was for that to last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.59,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:01.26,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,MayoPan's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.93,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ichiko? Ichiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.89,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm the only one left now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.14,0:06:21.15,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\c&HF3DDD3&\3c&H883F3B&\pos(338.5,15)}coffee beans: not even funny\NIron Deficiency: Your ideas blow, just quit now\Nyani-yani: Stop streaming\Naieuo: Masakichi trying to rack up viewers\NGen: Get on with it already. Don't keep us waiting\NPassion Exploitation: What happened to all that\Nvampire stuff???\Ntaiyaki: boring\NJelly-beans: Everyone! I saw a post saying\Nthe stream is over!!\NPraying Owl: Snoozefest, what a waste of time\Nmasa: this is all masakichi's fault\Nrice on rice: she'll pay\Nribon: Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\NWhere's Live-sama...? Where's Live-sama...?\NStalemate Gamer: Awful stream.\NGive me my time back\Neeeeeeks: What a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:27.05,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.96,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,where I first met Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.34,0:06:36.17,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This is all Live's fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Where the hell {\i1}is{\i0} she?!
