Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:08.44,Default,Masaki/Oedo,0,0,0,,"Ah, another one of Masakichi's ideas?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:14.37,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&HFFF0BB&\3c&H9B5E2D&\pos(347.5,16)}Work: So many trolls lol\Nenergy: Please do something about this\NLemon Sour: Is it coming back?\N\NLonely Oedo Girl: Ah, another one\Nof Masakichi's ideas? Whenever she\Ngets stoked, it always ends in trouble\N\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(5654,5904,\alpha&H00&)}Lonely Oedo Girl: Hilarious how she\Nhasn't changed at all since the\NHype-Sis days
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:11.37,DefaultItalics,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Whenever she gets stoked, \Nit always ends in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.37,DefaultItalics,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Hilarious how she hasn't changed \Nat all since the Hype-Sis days!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.37,0:07:15.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.74,0:07:18.37,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fad(278,1)\an9\fs20\c&HFEF8B8&\3c&HAB7531&\pos(623,44.5)}Lonely Oedo Girl: So now she's ruining MayoPan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:18.37,DefaultItalics,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,So now she's ruining MayoPan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:22.25,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\q2\fs20\c&HFEF8B8&\3c&HAB7531&\pos(50,44.5)}Lonely Oedo Girl: Oh, is she suddenly going to turn things around\Nfor some real hype?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:22.25,DefaultItalics,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,Oh, is she suddenly going to turn \Nthings around for some real hype?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.13,Default,Masaki/Oedo,0,0,0,,"I can't wait!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.13,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs20\c&HFEF8B8&\3c&HAB7531&\pos(607.5,116.5)}Lonely Oedo Girl: I can't wait lmao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:25.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.85,0:07:27.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What the hell's your deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:28.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:30.05,Flashback,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,You're Masakichi-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.59,Flashback,Oedo Girl,0,0,0,,I'm a huge fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:33.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's what you said!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So why this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.81,0:07:36.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What's even going through your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:40.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Do you {\i1}know{\i0} what I've gone through \Nbecause of comments like yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Get a life, you goddamn idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:51.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Is she just having fun stirring the pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:57.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Am I taking this way too seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:58.41,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&HF8EDC8&\3c&H774A33&\pos(228,20)}Lonely Oedo Girl: Ah, another one of Masakichi's ideas? Whenever she gets stoked, it always ends in trouble\NLonely Oedo Girl: Hilarious how she hasn't changed\Nat all since the Hype-Sis days\NLonely Oedo Girl: So now she's ruining MayoPan? lmao\NLonely Oedo Girl: Oh, is she suddenly going to\Nturn things around for some real hype?\NLonely Oedo Girl: I can't wait lmao\Nmumu: If Live was here...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:08.17,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,266)\fs18\c&HFCF1E5&\3c&H7B4F2F&\pos(213,21)}If the abuser wants to show her face, then go ahead\NI wouldn't mind seeing Masakichi. In a lot...{cut off}\NGo away scumbag
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:11.67,Signs_Chat,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&HF8EDC8&\3c&H774A33&\pos(228,20)}thxbye: I wouldn't mind seeing Masakichi. In...\NAsahitaro: Go away scumbag\NMomo: To tell you the truth, I don't hate Masakichi\Nthat much either...\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(2320,2528,\alpha&H00&)}dedesuke: [Newsflash] Masakichi on the run\N[Newsflash] Masakichi on the run [Newsflash] Masakichi\Non the run [Newsflash] Masakichi on the run [Newsflash]\NMasakichi on the run [Newsflash] Masakichi on the run\N{\alpha&HFF&\t(3237,3362,\alpha&H00&)}chelly-blossoms: I'll always be Masakichi-san's fan
