Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.10,0:08:13.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.56,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Of course there are people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.13,0:08:26.94,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,who really hate me, \Nas well as those having fun trolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.31,0:08:30.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But there are also people who support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:33.05,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,A very small number, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:36.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No matter how much I try, I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:39.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I can't tell how any of these \Npeople feel about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.30,0:08:42.23,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I never will, and when all's \Nsaid and done, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:45.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But one thing's for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:48.00,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fay-0.25\pos(466,185.5)\c&HEAEEED&\blur3\b0}watching now
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.33,0:08:48.00,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fay-0.25\pos(466,185.5)\c&HEAEEED&\b0}watching now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.82,0:08:48.62,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Everyone's here to watch MayoPan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Our haters...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and our supporters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.59,0:08:57.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So no matter what anyone thinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I've gotta continue the stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:11.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.22,0:09:11.11,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:07.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:08.78,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Mayonaka Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.78,0:09:10.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Staff member Masakichi here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.20,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:28.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord4}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&H9B4AE0&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.36,0:09:28.83,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,53)\3c&H9B4AE0&\bord2.5}Livestream to hit {\c&H9B4AE0&\3c&HFFFFFF&}1,000,000 subscribers!!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,"How dare you show your face on camera?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.61,0:09:18.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.25,0:09:20.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:24.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I can't let this livestream end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I can't let this be the end for MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.64,0:09:28.83,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So I have a favor to ask you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.74,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Let me join in on this game of tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:42.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And so, I'm the only one left now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.68,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If they catch me, \Nthe stream will immediately end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:50.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You may be surprised to hear \Nthat I'm pretty dang good at tag!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:53.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm a nasty piece of work—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:56.19,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.11,0:10:04.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made a \Nhuge mess of Hype-Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:12.75,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And I'm to blame for this as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.22,0:10:15.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For saying such awful things to Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:17.45,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:27.85,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why Live, all of MayoPan, \Nthe Hype-Sis girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.85,0:10:31.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,and all of you watching \Ndeserve an apology from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:33.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:53.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I know it's not something an apology will fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:58.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Still, I don't want to say goodbye to MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.29,0:11:03.61,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If there's anyone out there who wants \Nto show their support for MayoPan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,spread the word about this stream!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:10.31,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I, Masakichi, won't let myself \Nbe caught until Live shows up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:14.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\an7\c&H6A6A6A&\fs10\fscx85\3c&HFDFCFF&\pos(59.5,237.5)\frz3.047}Vampires Playing Tag in an Abandoned Hospital! No Stopping Until We Hit a Million Subs!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:14.82,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,MayoPan's going all out as usual, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:18.32,Default,TSUMA-shi,0,0,0,,It's not much, but the least \NI can do is lend a hand.
