Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:34.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,There's no way you're getting your hands on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.70,0:11:36.54,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.66,0:11:41.68,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Sorry, Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:46.51,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ever since we met, you've \Nalways been thinking about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:47.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:50.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll keep up this game of tag, \Neven if I break my leg!
