Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:43.70,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Give up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:52.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This game's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.53,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,You've all lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.90,0:12:58.38,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Stop the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.38,0:13:00.04,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,D-Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.04,0:13:01.38,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If you come any closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.93,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:06.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:09.69,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to be on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:10.76,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:12.49,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For MayoPan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:15.15,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Not to mention everyone watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.15,0:13:15.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.99,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,If we reach a million subs, \NI want all of them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:19.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,And Banpai Manor—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:19.90,DefaultTop,Leader,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.85,0:13:25.55,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,I'm asking about {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.50,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:28.44,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:29.45,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:32.36,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Like I said, so MayoPan can live on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:33.79,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:38.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,This may be an atrocious idea \Nthat doesn't make any sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,but they gave their all for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:41.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:45.34,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Even though I know no one wants to watch me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.47,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Everyone, forget what I just said!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:52.14,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll do everything I can \Nuntil Live comes back...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:54.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:59.48,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2.5\an7\fs18\c&H693C55&\3c&HC194AD&}Vampires Playing Tag in an Abandoned Hospital! No Stopping Until We Hit a Million Subs!!\N{\c&HE1BEC8&\3c&HB550A1&}10k watching now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.13,0:13:59.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,When did all these people...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.32,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,In the end, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:07.24,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Let me ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.61,0:14:09.86,Default,Leader,0,0,0,,Why did you decide to be on camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.37,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:14.12,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H76F4F6&\3c&H024BEF&}Visiting an abandoned hospital!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:24.66,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I mean, that's obvious, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.66,0:14:28.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Because... Because... Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.05,0:14:31.60,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Because I {\i1}want{\i0} to, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:45.77,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,The truth is, I want to feel wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:48.57,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Even now, I want them to enjoy watching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:52.18,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,But I know that's too much to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.33,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.13,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're watching this stream, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:04.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I showed my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.84,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I didn't run away this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:07.97,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Did you forget our deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:09.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You promised me, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.81,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,To make a meal of me \Nonce we hit a million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:15.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So hurry up and show yourself already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:20.64,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I won't let myself be caught just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.27,0:15:28.55,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:30.82,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:32.89,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll make sure the stream goes on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.89,0:15:35.79,DefaultItalics,Masaki,0,0,0,,I won't let it all end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.17,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm here for you, Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.95,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What took you so long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:54.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,No, I was in the wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.98,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, I'm sorry for all \Nthe awful things I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.77,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.91,0:16:03.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,How you really felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.94,Default,Live,0,0,0,,That you wanted to be in our videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:09.82,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You knew already, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:13.28,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're the vampire who knows me \Nbetter than anyone else, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:16.53,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I wanted to hear {\i1}you{\i0} say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:18.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So I'm really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.65,0:16:19.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.96,0:16:20.72,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You're happy you heard me say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:25.67,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.80,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Live, you heard us talking just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:31.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:36.43,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.43,0:16:37.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:40.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:44.82,Default,Kikka,0,0,0,,It went off without a hitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:45.86,Default,Otomi,0,0,0,,What a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.86,0:16:47.41,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Masakichi's back in action.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.91,Default,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,The hunters were...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.91,0:16:51.12,Default,Outlaw,0,0,0,,Us Outside Kids, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:52.90,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Hype-Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.40,0:16:58.64,Default,Sidebrah,0,0,0,,Tokage-nee-san, your athletic skills \Nare, like, totally out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:16:59.37,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Whoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:01.48,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,I mean, that's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:03.89,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Because, because, because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.89,0:17:06.54,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Because I {\i1}want{\i0} to, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:13.72,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone! All together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:18.18,Default,Group,0,0,0,,You got pranked!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(233,1)\fs40\bord4\fnArial Black\c&H7E3FA4&\3c&HFADAC0&}Y{\c&H9E6011&}o{\c&H5F7B3A&}u {\c&H9B3CA9&}G{\c&HD13D0F&}o{\c&H58539F&}t {\c&H7E3FA4&}P{\c&H9E6011&}r{\c&H5F7B3A&}a{\c&H9B3CA9&}n{\c&HD13D0F&}k{\c&H58539F&}e{\c&H7E3FA4&}d{\c&H9E6011&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(355,1)\fs40\fnArial Black\c&H51457D&\3c&H51457D&\4c&H51457D&\bord4\shad2\pos(518.5,24.5)}You Got\NPranked!!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.97,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(355,1)\fs40\fnArial Black\c&H6D4ED8&\3c&HEDE8EE&\bord3\pos(518.5,24.5)}You Got\N{\c&H4EFEEF&\3c&H5333DB&}Pranked!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.56,Default,Plumb Wrong Logic,0,0,0,,Impeccable timing, Mastamin-nee-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:24.35,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't call me Mastamin-nee-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:30.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs26\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,54)\3c&H000000&\bord3\blur0.4}"Would Masakichi Show Up on Stream for MayoPan?"
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.35,0:17:30.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs26\fnTimes New Roman\pos(320,54)\c&H000000&\3c&HF2F4F5&\bord2\blur0.2}"Would {\c&H3E0CB7&}Masakichi{\c&H000000&} Show Up on {\c&H3E0CB7&}Stream{\c&H000000&} for {\c&H3E0CB7&}MayoPan{\c&H000000&}?"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:30.61,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs25\bord4\fnArial Black\c&H7E3FA4&\3c&HECE7E1&\pos(480,131.5)}Y{\c&H9E6011&}o{\c&H5F7B3A&}u {\c&H9B3CA9&}G{\c&HD13D0F&}o{\c&H58539F&}t {\c&H7E3FA4&}P{\c&H9E6011&}r{\c&H5F7B3A&}a{\c&H9B3CA9&}n{\c&HD13D0F&}k{\c&H58539F&}e{\c&H7E3FA4&}d{\c&H9E6011&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:26.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:30.61,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So sorry for making all of you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.11,0:17:36.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I didn't think it'd all work out this well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.11,0:17:39.84,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All righty, time to explain how it went down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:41.33,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, hold that thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.28,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masakichi, why don't we—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.37,0:17:43.95,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,You bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.74,0:17:46.46,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.23,0:17:52.63,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,Live-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:59.89,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We sincerely apologize for putting on \Nthis preposterous stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:05.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,It all started when Masakichi ran out of \Nthe house, refusing to star in our videos,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.44,0:18:08.11,Default,Live,0,0,0,,which was when I came up with this prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:12.66,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We'll explain all the nitty-gritty \Ndetails later in a separate video.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.66,0:18:13.92,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Huh? Vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:16.44,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Of course there's no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.00,0:18:16.44,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:17.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,We're really...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.28,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Very sorry about what we did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:25.48,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You got all of them involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.12,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Wait, if it was you under this mask,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:30.25,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,were you the one who attacked our car?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.17,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Th-That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.34,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,I immediately changed my outfit \Nto meet up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What about Banpai Manor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:38.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Just normal repairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.30,0:18:40.65,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,For a house that might get torn down?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.65,0:18:42.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What about Ai-san, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:44.56,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,I came up with that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.33,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Changing one letter in Live gives you Love!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:49.00,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,That's what "Ai" means!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.94,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs40\pos(554.5,120)\c&H735BD8&\3c&HF2F3FD&\bord2}Ai
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.35,0:18:54.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,So the part about Live remembering \Nwhat happened twenty years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.57,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Oh, that part's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:56.21,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:19:00.53,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Man, the two of us really are \Nfated to be together!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.91,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:03.98,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:06.56,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Well, then... Once again, \Nlet's aim for one million!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:08.29,Default,Live,0,0,0,,We have one month left!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:10.30,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:13.40,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Today being the deadline was a lie as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:14.10,DefaultTop,Live,0,0,0,,Once we reach it, I can go ahead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.10,0:19:14.63,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.63,0:19:17.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I can make a meal of you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.90,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,That's null and void now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.91,Default,Live,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:50.93,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,We're truly, {\i1}truly{\i0} sorry \Nabout our past livestream!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:53.31,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Not you too, Shigeyuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:54.82,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, but it's all okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:58.62,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not a single person who watched \Nbelieves that vampires exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:20:59.19,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H5A32C4&\frz15.71\pos(253,65.5)\shad2}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.62,0:20:59.82,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Right? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.19,0:20:59.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H5A32C4&\shad2\frz344.4\pos(331.5,43.5)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.29,0:21:08.02,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,It seems this served as a good \Nopportunity for that human, Masaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.33,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:13.61,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,I have to say, the bonds between \NLive and Masaki are strong indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:16.15,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,They certainly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:22.85,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Agh! I'm sick and tired of being a vampire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:25.13,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,What's wrong with going out during the day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.97,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,I-I'm done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.97,0:21:37.92,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:41.57,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,A talking bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.18,0:21:43.50,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:46.82,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,L-Let me have some blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:49.15,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Make a meal of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.15,0:21:50.33,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:53.33,Flashback,Live,0,0,0,,Time to dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.33,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(232,1)\fs40\shad2\fnArial Black\c&H7647ED&\4c&H77825C&\pos(203.5,24)}Chomp!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.40,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:56.65,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:58.98,Flashback,Masaki,0,0,0,,Go away, you dumb bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:03.00,FlashbackTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.74,0:22:02.08,Flashback,Masaki's Mom,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Masaki-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:04.88,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,She saved Live's life, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:08.65,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,So that's why she can't forget that taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:12.51,Default,Yuki,0,0,0,,Well, she ended up sleeping \Nfor twenty years after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:14.58,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:16.29,Default,Fu,0,0,0,,Tokage-san, you can park the car over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:18.42,Default,Tokage,0,0,0,,Sheesh, why's it {\i1}my{\i0} job...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:22.40,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.66,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I mean it, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.66,0:22:28.46,Default,Live,0,0,0,,But you know, that prank was \Nmy way of showing how much I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:29.88,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:32.69,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll work even harder on \Nour videos starting tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:35.16,Default,Live,0,0,0,,I'll make sure we hit a million subs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.16,0:22:37.38,Default,Live,0,0,0,,So our deal about your blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.38,0:22:39.29,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Ah, sure, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.66,0:22:41.67,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:45.96,Default,Live,0,0,0,,No backsies, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:48.34,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Let's go shoot a video together right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:48.34,DefaultTop,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:51.97,Default,Ichiko,0,0,0,,What are you two ditching for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:02.08,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Hey, Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:04.02,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Can you slow it down a bit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.12,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Masaki, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.12,0:23:07.24,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,Huh? For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.24,0:23:10.74,Default,Live,0,0,0,,For teaching us all about videos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.48,0:23:15.32,Default,Live,0,0,0,,And bringing us out into the world \Nfrom the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.23,0:23:20.00,Default,Masaki,0,0,0,,You did the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.73,0:23:23.63,Default,Live,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:26.30,Default,Live,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.74,0:23:36.01,Default,Group,0,0,0,,Good morning from the dead of night!
